    "assumptions": [
      "Every numeric value in this profile is synthetic and exists only to exercise schema and evidence-handling paths.",
      "The profile is not a proposed production specification and is not calibrated to any real vehicle.",
      "The values must not be used to select components, estimate roadworthiness or predict real braking distance."
